   "type": "hero_update",
   "title": "Introducing Freja",
   "role": null,
   "description": "As head of Search and Rescue, Freja Skov dedicated her life to Overwatch and its mission of global peace. With the agency’s resources, there was no one Freja couldn’t find, no victim beyond her reach. But when Overwatch disbanded, Freja found herself adrift, purposeless... until she found a new market for her talent. As a bounty hunter, Freja attracted a different kind of clientele, one that showed her the true value of her skills. Now through March 24, get hands-on with her powerful crossbow, explosive bolts, and game-changing Ultimate. With a dynamic, strategy-driven kit, she’s built for players who thrive on precision and positioning—and she never misses her mark.",
